  "details": "# Issue:\nCurrently you have no way of knowing someone might be using Earmuff. This could result in you talking to someone without knowing they might not hear you.\n# Suggestion:\nAdd a small Icon to the Nameplate that indicates someone is using Earmuff. This could be always shown or only when you have the Quick Menu open. Maybe add it next to the Avatar Interaction Icon? I'm not sure, but there should be a way to know when someone is using it.",
